{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SIN CARDS</strong> is a horror-themed card game where you must build the ultimate deck to survive the nightmares of the Netherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/e4a2a3be51981efd4aa74284688592b3.avif?t=1753258507\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbCombine strategy and luck as you collect and purchase powerful cards, craft deadly combos, and face off against terrifying monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/603c46e5682abaea78b926526264e696.avif?t=1753258507\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbDemons gradually grow stronger and more aggressive under the control of Delilah, the sinister voice of the Netherworld, a manipulative and mocking presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/darkfantasy-enthralled.png?t=1753258507\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbEach level introduces increasing difficulty and new mechanics like crafting, mining, and fishing. Craft hero items using resources and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/Items1.png?t=1753258507\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbPersistent Skilltree, Sin Coin Slots, Roulette-Style Games and Lore Expansions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/Xlore1.png?t=1753258507\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/Xslots.png?t=1753258507\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/Xskilltree.png?t=1753258507\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbEach new level reveals more lore about the Sin Cards and the demons that inhabit the world.\u00a0Some say the choices you make reveal the lengths you're willing to go to <span class=\"bb_strike\">survive</span> permadeath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/extras/TESTDeckIcon.png?t=1753258507\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411930?t=1753258507","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753258507","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/ec80a495196d48afe5d5ccebdd2477cff60cd96f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753258507","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411930/ec80a495196d48afe5d5ccebdd2477cff60cd96f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753258507","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"SIN CARDS features mature themes, including blood, gore, and suggestive imagery. Rooms may be drenched in blood and filled with unsettling sounds. Players can also use in-game Sin Coins to wager for powerful items, risking everything for a chance at survival."},"demos":[{"appid":3414590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SIN CARDS</strong> is a horror-themed card game where you must build the ultimate deck to survive the nightmares of the 